  dialogue:
  - Jester:What is wrong with you, kid?! I know I ignored you, but jeez, let a mad
    scientist work on his invention in PEACE for once!
  - "Jester:Don\u2019t you think I have enough problems out here without your meddling
    in my defenses?"
  - Dahlia:...
  - "Jester:Well well well\u2026 since you threw a bomb at my invention\u2026 and
    you think it\u2019s a\u2026 ha ha\u2026 LAUGHING matter\u2026"
  - "Jester:Well\u2026 let\u2019s see how you like a bomb in your face!"
